# Line-ending policy. Determinism matters: golden test values, ffmpeg filter
# strings, CryptoBind canonical strings, LUT .cube files and worker code must be
# byte-stable across machines + CI, or parity/hash/signature checks can drift.
# Normalize ALL text to LF in the repo AND on checkout (no CRLF anywhere).
* text=auto eol=lf

# SQL migrations are pasted into the Supabase SQL Editor -- LF so the first line
# is never mangled, ASCII-only separators (memory: feedback-sql-ascii-only).
*.sql text eol=lf

# LUT cubes are parsed for the render + GL preview -- keep them LF text.
*.cube text eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch (git also auto-detects; this is explicit).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
